::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you have a license?
:::'''Cable Car Operator:''' Oh, uh, I'm afraid you might have to make an exception, {{MC|ж=miss|м=mr}}. My license has expired, but then I haven't had the chance to go up and renew it for 10 years now...
