===Talk to Bronya{{subst:void|<!--101150204-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Qlipoth Fort|update|The story ended and Bronya succeeded as the Supreme Guardian. The Overworld and Underworld reunited to create a complete Belobog.<br />All things must end. There is always a bit of sadness at the time of farewell.<br />It is best to talk to Bronya again before you leave and tell her everything you heard from Welt.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''March 7th:''' Ah, it's Gepard! Is he here to meet us?
:'''Dan Heng:''' He's still on duty. Huh, he must have recovered quickly.
:'''March 7th:''' Let's go say hi.
:'''Gepard:''' Welcome back to the Administrative District, Trailblazers.
:'''March 7th:''' Trailblazers... first time anyone's called us that on this planet!
:'''Gepard:''' The Architects think it's only right that we should address you properly. "Outsiders" is hardly fitting anymore.
:'''Gepard:''' ...Please allow me to apologize again for what happened in the restricted zone. You were only trying to help... I should've trusted Serval's judgment.
:You were just doing your job.
:'''Gepard:''' Thanks for understanding.
:Your sister knows what's up...
:'''Gepard:''' I'll keep that in mind, thanks.
:Ha! Didn't expect to get wrecked, huh?
:'''Gepard:''' You are excellent fighters. I'd love to have you provide training for the Guards, but I know you have places to be.
:'''Gepard:''' Lady Bronya's inaugural address will begin soon. She asked me to pass on her invitation to you.
:'''March 7th:''' Huh? That's sooner than I expected. Is she well enough to...
:'''Gepard:''' Not really... But Lady Bronya insisted on delivering the speech as soon as possible. She wants the people to understand what happened.
:'''Gepard:''' The address will be held at Everwinter Monument. I hope the three of you can find time to attend.
:'''March 7th:''' Look! There's a crowd gathering over there. Is the address starting soon?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Looks like it. Bronya hasn't arrived yet, though. Let's find somewhere to wait.
:'''Silvermane Guard Announcer:''' Guards, formation!
:'''March 7th:''' Whoa, this must be it.
:'''Silvermane Guard Announcer:''' Citizens of Belobog, I kindly ask for your attention! Lady Bronya Rand's inaugural address will begin shortly. Please remain orderly!
:'''Bronya:''' People of Belobog &mdash; hear me!
:'''Bronya:''' Today we gather here to celebrate our victory... but it was a sacrifice made by a mighty guardian that delivered us this opportunity. She dispelled an evil that cost us 700 years of suffering... and in the process, she paid the ultimate price.
:'''Bronya:''' The sacrifice of Cocolia Rand ushers in a new chapter. The blizzard beyond the walls will die away and the offensives of our Silvermane Guards will begin to contain the Fragmentum's advance.
:'''Bronya:''' In the far north, I witnessed with my own eyes the struggle between the late supreme guardian and the evil power that sought to destroy us. In her last moments, the supreme guardian told me her greatest regret...
:'''Bronya:''' ...The order to seal off the Underworld from the Overworld. With the passage of time, she gradually came to realize the consequences of that decision... Although tortured with guilt, she could not undo the damage.
:'''Bronya:''' In her final moments, she wanted us to mark the Stellaron's end by reuniting Belobog. Overworlders and Underworlders must embrace the dawn of a new age... together.
:'''Bronya:''' People of the Underworld, I dare not ask for your forgiveness &mdash; I now know the reality of your decade of suffering...
:'''Bronya:''' But I want us to work together. We know that without your perseverance and hard work, Belobog will not recover its former glory... and the seed of civilization will not be preserved.
:'''Bronya:''' ...And on that note, I'd like to extend my heartfelt gratitude to a few guests of the city.
:'''Bronya:''' Most of you were not aware of their arrival... but it is thanks to them that our world now flourishes with hope.
:'''Bronya:''' They made me realize that while we remain focused on "preserving" the ground beneath our feet, we should not forget to look up into the sky.
:'''Bronya:''' I firmly believe that with the determination of everyone, our world, the world the Trailblazers call "Jarilo-VI," will no longer be alone among the stars.
:'''Bronya:''' But before we accomplish that goal, I humbly ask you to follow me into the future...
:'''Bronya:''' I, Bronya Rand, the nineteenth guardian of Belobog, hereby take my oath...
:'''Onlookers:''' Lady Bronya! Lady Bronya! Long live Belobog!
:'''March 7th:''' Back in this office again... The last time I was here was... the last time I was here.
:'''March 7th:''' No more unnerving gaze this time! Hehe...
:'''March 7th:''' Bronya, we're back!
:'''Bronya:''' March, Dan Heng, (Trailblazer)... it's wonderful you made it to the address.
:'''Bronya:''' Sorry, I know the invitation was very last minute... but I needed to get the news out as soon as possible. The longer people waited, the more rumors started to swirl. The situation risked spinning out of control.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you fully recovered?
::'''Bronya:''' Yes, I'm fine now. Don't worry.
::'''Bronya:''' My mother... she tried to force the voice of the Stellaron into my head... It was a terrible feeling. I don't know what would've happened if you hadn't shown up.
::Was Seele not there for the address?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Was Seele not there for the address?
:'''Bronya:''' She was there. She just made sure no one could see her.
:'''Bronya:''' Seele is still new to the vastness of the Overworld &mdash; she feels uncomfortable in a big crowd... I'll help her adjust to life here.
:'''March 7th:''' That was some speech, Bronya! If I had to talk like that in front of a huge crowd, I'd be shaking head to toe!
:'''Bronya:''' It was all just a bunch of palatable lies. I hope you never have a similar experience, March.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The part about preserving the seed of civilization was real.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's what you do as a leader that matters.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sometimes people need to hear white lies.
:'''Bronya:''' Mm... I'd prefer to be honest with the people... but I also want to preserve their hope.
:'''March 7th:''' ...Dan Heng, wanna... talk about Mr. Yang's findings?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Mm, allow me to explain.
:Telling Bronya about Welt's observations...
:'''Bronya:''' ...Which means the Fragmentum has already taken root by this point. Even though the Stellaron is sealed, we won't be able to reverse the damage immediately...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Stellarons are terrible things.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sorry, we promised you...
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We will find a way to root out the Fragmentum.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Astral Express will do everything within our power to help.
:'''Bronya:''' Besides, I agree with Mr. Yang. Ultimately, the fate of Belobog is in the hands of its own people...
:{{tx}}
----
:'''March 7th:''' Congrats, (Trailblazer)! That was one heck of a first trailblazing expedition!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Worth celebrating, I'd say.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} On a scale from 1 to 5, how would you rate this journey...
:'''Dan Heng and March 7th:''' Two point five. Five!
:'''March 7th:''' ...What!? That run-of-the-mill, huh?
:'''Dan Heng:''' My scoring criteria are different from yours.
:'''March 7th:''' Ugh! Anyway, we should be asking (Trailblazer)... Any thoughts you want to share?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Time for a nap...
::'''March 7th:''' Wait, what? No way &mdash; we're about to leave and I've hardly got any decent photos.
::'''March 7th:''' Come on, let's go back to the Administrative District and hang out for a bit longer!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I feel like I could fight a hundred more monsters!
::'''March 7th:''' That's the spirit! Come on, we should take some more photos before we head back to the Express.
::'''March 7th:''' Let's go! One more round in the Administrative District!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What will the next adventure be like?
::'''March 7th:''' Equally unforgettable, I'm sure. Anyway, don't worry about the future &mdash; live in the moment!
::'''March 7th:''' Let's go for one more round in the Administrative District! I wanna take more photos!
----
