;(Talk to Seele)
:'''Seele:''' The inauguration ceremony went very smoothly. I didn't expect so many Underworlders to come and listen to the address.
:'''Seele:''' Everyone seemed supportive, too. Seems like Bronya made a pretty good impression on them.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Maybe Natasha and Oleg helped promote her a little.
::'''Seele:''' Possibly. They always think ahead.
::'''Seele:''' If those two approve of Bronya, then everyone following Wildfire won't question her either.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Were you there? I don't think I saw you.
::'''Seele:''' Of course I was! I was just hidden in the crowd. I'm glad you didn't notice me &mdash; means I'm doing something right. I want to protect Bronya in my own way.
::'''Seele:''' She wanted me to stand next to her, but I'm glad I stuck to my guns. Besides, I'm not sure I could handle that many people staring at me.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} She will be an outstanding leader.
